<title>FRANCE: Ciments Francais extends gains after suspension.</title>
<headline>Ciments Francais extends gains after suspension.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Ciments Francais extended their gains after a 15 minute limit-up suspension following a 10 percent rise.</p>
<p>At 0836 GMT, the shares were up 9.91 percent at 231.80 after a high of 242 francs, close to the upper limit at 243.40 at which a further suspension would be triggered.</p>
<p>The building materials company, controlled by Italcementi, said on Wednesday that it expected a significant rise in its second half results.</p>
